# [TD] CrystAlien Conflict Reinforcements

EA has not endorsed and does not support this product.

Adds LEGO Mars Mission: CrystAlien Conflict units and buildings alongside the existing GDI and Nod roster.

For manual installation, copy this folder to Documents/CnCRemastered/Mods/Tiberian_Dawn/CrystAlienConflictPlus.
Enable it in the Tiberian Dawn Mods menu and restart. Enable only one of
Factions and Reinforcements at a time. Both provide their own game DLL.
Use single-player Skirmish or custom missions; online multiplayer is unsupported.

DLL source and build instructions: Source/CrystAlienConflict-DLL-source.zip.
See LICENSE-EA-GPLv3.md for the DLL license. Original LEGO / 4T2 artwork,
music and sound remain the property of their respective owners.
